openEuler 24.03 LTS native build inputs

This source supplies a build prerequisite for the native perl-DBD-Pg checks.
The dependency repository does not select a PostgreSQL server for the normal
xCAT/xCATsn closure. PostgreSQL backend runtime qualification is separate.

